    "title": "Baly | Order Taxi and Food",
    "description": "Book your ride today and enjoy affordability\r\nOr order from the best restaurants\r\n\r\nindeed! The newest application in Iraq is specialized in ride hailing and food delivery.\r\n\r\nBaly Taxi for transportation:\r\nThe application allows passengers to choose the preferred type of car and preferred payment method, all of this, at competitive prices in the market because Baly always saves you 50% of market prices.\r\n\r\nOrdering from the Baly app is easy and takes 4 simple steps!\r\n- Locate your location\r\n- select your destination\r\n- book\r\n- enjoy the trip!\r\n\r\nInformation that may interest you!\r\nGPS tracking feature \r\nChoose between private cars or taxis\r\nChoose payment method \r\nDriver Rating \r\n----------------\r\nBaly - food delivery\r\nLocal food restaurants one touch away. Endless offers and discounts on delivery! Your favorite food (burger, pizza, chicken, pasta, cake, crepe and more)\r\nOrder your meal today and enjoy the benefits\r\n\r\nOrder location tracking\r\nPictures are priced appropriately\r\nelectronic wallet",
